**Given:**

A card is drawn at random from a pack of playing cards. What is the probability of getting a face card?

**Formula used:**

Probability (P) = dfrac{{Number of favorable outcomes}}{{Total number of outcomes}}

**Calculation:**

Total number of cards = 52

Number of face cards = 12 (4 Jacks, 4 Queens, 4 Kings)

⇒ Probability (P) = dfrac{12}{52}

⇒ Probability (P) = dfrac{3}{13}

**∴ The correct answer is option 3.**
